    "long_instructions": "TODOs:\r\n- Open index.html to see the decision wheel and the prompt dial controls.\r\n- Toggle the \"Colorful Segments\" switch to add or remove color details.\r\n- Toggle the \"Show Segment Labels\" switch to add or remove text details.\r\n- Observe how adding or removing these 'details' changes the appearance of the decision wheel.\r\n- Understand that each switch represents a detail you might add to a prompt.",
